5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm the Seer. I'll find the wolf. Stay calm, everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"A wise start, Takumi. Let us listen carefully to the wisdom of the night.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I trust you all. Let’s stay calm and listen carefully to what happens tonight.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I observe. Silence is often more revealing than words. Let us see who trembles first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I assess the situation logically. Takumi’s claim is unverified. We must wait for evidence before acting.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I won't back down. I know the truth. Trust me, or regret it later.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,Trust is the bridge between fear and action. Let us not fracture before the night reveals its secrets.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. We need unity. Let’s not jump to conclusions before the night brings us answers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Ryuji is right. Evidence precedes action. I will remain silent and watch.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I stand by my position. Premature accusations breed chaos. We must let the night speak before we judge anyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I won't beg for trust. I'll prove it. Stay alert, or the wolf eats you first.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Fear is a poor compass. Let patience guide us. The night holds the truth, not our impatience.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I hear you, Takumi. Your determination is admirable. Let us remain united and patient. The night will reveal the truth to us all.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Midori’s warmth is a distraction. The wolf hides in plain sight. I will not be swayed by sentiment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Toshio, your cynicism is noted. I remain objective. We need data, not drama. Let us wait for the night to provide facts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I’m done. The night decides. I’ll act on the truth, not your doubts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
