31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I know the truth. Ryuji is human. The wolf is among us. Who else is clean?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,A good start. Knowing one is safe narrows our search. Let us use this clarity to find the true threat.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’m relieved to hear that. Knowing one person is safe helps us focus. Let’s stay calm and listen to the others.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Ryuji is human. That leaves four suspects. I will watch your reactions closely.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am human. Takumi’s claim is consistent. We must now identify the wolf among the remaining three.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Midori, you’re my prime suspect. Your calm is suspicious. Why are you so relaxed?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, do not let suspicion cloud your judgment. Midori’s calm is a shield, not a weapon. We must seek truth, not conflict.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I’m sorry, Takumi. I’m just trying to keep us calm. I’m not hiding anything.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Midori’s apology is a tactic. Takumi’s accusation is reckless. I remain neutral.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Midori’s defensiveness is noted. Takumi, your accusation lacks logical basis. We need more data before targeting anyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about your logic. Midori is the wolf. I saw her. Vote her, or I'll burn this village down.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your anger is a storm that blinds you. Do not let rage dictate our justice. We must seek truth, not vengeance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Takumi, please stop. Your anger is frightening. I am just a villager trying to help. Don't let fear make you blind to the real danger.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Takumi’s threat is irrational. Midori’s fear is genuine. I will not be manipulated by his outburst.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Takumi, your threat is illogical. Midori’s fear is a genuine human reaction. We must not execute based on emotion.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I stand by my word. Midori is the wolf. Vote her. I will not be silenced by your cowardice.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
